# Authored structure reviews and gallery images are part of their source bundles.
!content/worldgen/source/places/**/shots/
!content/worldgen/source/places/**/shots/**
!content/worldgen/source/reusable/**/shots/
!content/worldgen/source/reusable/**/shots/**
