# GLBs are build outputs of checked-in generators (pnpm assets:build), pinned by asset-lock.json
# and published as release snapshots (pnpm assets:fetch). See content/ASSET-PACKS.md.
*.glb
# Authored masters with no generator are source; asset-build.json lists them as "masters".
!content/entities/source/vehicles/*/models/source.glb
examples/*/public/packs/

# docs-site: pages generated from packages/, docs-src/ and examples/ (pnpm docs:site:gen).
# .vitepress/generated-nav.json IS committed — `pnpm docs:site:check` verifies it in CI.
docs-site/api/
docs-site/guide/
docs-site/schemas/
docs-site/samples/
docs-site/reference/
docs-site/public/
docs-site/.vitepress/cache/
/archive
